  "citation": "Sloan V; Norby R (2014): Intensive Site 1 Vegetation Plot Photos, Barrow, Alaska, 2012. Next-Generation Ecosystem Experiments (NGEE) Arctic. Dataset. doi:10.5440/1177280",
